+It lives exactly as long as its attempt. Ordinary delivery retry keeps the attempt, so it keeps the same authority. Authorized takeover replaces the attempt, so it replaces the authority, and the superseded attempt's authority stops working when the epoch advances. The next exchange begins with a new attempt and a new authority. The [delivery reporting capability](#delivery-reporting-boundary) is a different thing with a shorter life, one physical delivery. Neither stands in for the other: a delivery report cannot propose anything, and submission authority reports nothing about delivery.
